  "referenceNumber": "SUD0068",
  "remarks": "\nThe Secretary of State considers has reasonable grounds to suspect that Hamdan AL-KAJLI \nis an involved person under the Sudan (Sanctions) (EU Exit) Regulations 2020\n \nbased on the following grounds:\n \n \nhe is or has been involved in a relevant activity, namely he is responsible for the commission of violations of international humanitarian law in Sudan, including rape and other forms of sexual and gender-based violence, through his role a Commander of the Rapid Support Forces.\n \nhe is associated with an involved person, Abdul Rahim Daglo, who is Deputy Leader of the Rapid Support Forces\n",
